    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG Brian MacMahon is delighted to bring to the market 216 Coill Tire a spacious 3-bedroom first floor apartment. Its location is second to none, walking distance to all the many wonderful amenities Doughiska has to offer including its primary and secondary schools. Situated in a quiet cul de sac, with a large, shared garden to the rear. Magnificently maintained by its present owners, this property would make an excellent starter home or investment property. \n\nAccommodation is comprised as follows: entrance hallway, open plan living/dining area, a spacious kitchen, utility, 3 good-sized bedrooms with the master boasting an ensuite and a main family bathroom completes this beautiful home.\n\nCoille Tire is a popular development in Doughiska on the out skirts of Galway city. It is walking distance to most amenities, Briarhill shopping centre, pharmacy, Clayton hotel and is close-by to the Galway clinic, Merlin Park hospital and the Bons Secour hospital, Merlin Woods School and Merlin college and ATU. There are excellent transport links with a regular Bus Eireann and city bus service to and from the city centre and easy access to the M6/M18 motorway.\n\nSERVICES: Mains Water & Sewerage\nHEATING SYSTEM: Gas Central Heating\nMANAGEMENT FEES: 1,510 Per annum includes bins\nPROPERTY SIZE 118 m²\nPROPERTY AGE: 2006\nBER: B2 118470905 100.31 (kWh/m2/yr) 17.85 (kgCO2/m2/yr) EXP: 26/05/2035"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nHALLWAY - 6m x 1.4m\nWooden flooring, Carpeted Stairs, Coving\n\nLIVING/DINING - 6.9m x 4.5m\nWooden Flooring, Coving, Patio door/balcony\n\nKITCHEN - 2.5m x 3.7m\nTiled Flooring, Splashback, shaker style fitted wall & floor units\n\nUTILITY - 2.5m x1.7m\nFitted Floor Units, Plumbed for Washer/Dryer, Shelving\n\nMASTER BEDROOM - 4.7m x 3.5m\nWooden flooding, Fitted wardrobe\n\nENSUITE - 2.5m x 1m\nTiled flooring, Shower, W.C, W.H.B\n\nBEDROOM 2 - 4.2m x 3.4m\nWooden flooring, Fitted Wardrobe\n\nBEDROOM 3 - 3.5m x 3.5m\nWooden flooring\n\nBATHROOM - 3.5m x 2m\nTiled flooring, W.C, W.H.B, Bath with shower over\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Spectacular 3 Bedroom Apartment (One Ensuite)</li><li> Located in the much sought-after Coill Tire Estate</li><li> Walking distance to Merlin Park Woods & Doughiska Playground</li><li> Close to all the amenities</li><li> Turn key condition</li><li> Excellent storage space</ul>"
